4666 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Wherever there is a need to spell the name of the company\054 on public pages\054 on social networks\054 in\ne\055mails\054 letters\054 we spell the name of the company as follows\072 \034VITech\035\056 Alternative ways of spelling the company name\054 such as \034V\056I\056Tech\035\054 \034VITECH\035\054 \035Vitech\035\054\035vitech\035 are considered incorrect\056\n\nWe pronounce it \133vi\320ajtek\135\056)
