  << /ActualText (Roboto Regular is built for ease\054 comfort\054 and clarity\056 Its neutral tone supports our writing without drawing attention to itself\054 allowing the message \024 not the medium \024 to connect with the reader\056 It reflects the empathetic and respectful nature of our brand\054 offering a smooth reading experience that aligns with how we want people to feel\072 welcomed\054 informed\054 and supported\056 Roboto Regular helps us speak with precision\054 never cluttered\056)
