5100 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Paragraphs should be clear\054 structured\054 and easy to read\056 The recommended line height is 140\045\054 with an ideal line length of approximately 70 characters\056\nThis improves legibility and creates a comfortable reading rhythm\054 especially\nin longer content blocks\056\n\nAvoid visual clutter within body copy\072 underlines\054 italics\054 caps lock\054 colored text\054 or frequent use of bold\056 The message should remain calm\054 focused\054 and free of visual noise\056\n\nHowever\054 bold may be used sparingly to highlight essential terms or concepts \024 only when doing so adds clarity or draws attention to a critical point\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 5101 0 R
     /Pg 3299 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
